  "id": "cognitive-complexity",
  "term": "cognitive complexity",
  "definition": "Cognitive complexity is the degree of mental demand involved in a task, especially when it requires coordinating multiple kinds of information and responses at the same time. In this source, it refers to the added challenge of managing auditory and visual input together while producing spoken output, which places heavier demands on attention and cognitive resources.",
